              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ũũ nĩw’o Mwĩaĩi Yeova ũnũkwasya: Mbingĩlo ya nza ya nthĩnĩ ĩla yelekele wumĩlonĩ wa syũa ĩkavingwa mĩthenya thanthatũ ya kũtethya wĩa; ĩndĩ mũthenya wa savato ĩkavingũwa, na mũthenya wa mũtiso wa mwei ĩkavingũwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
