              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na nthembo ya kũvĩv’wa ĩla mũnene wĩ mbee ũsumbĩnĩ ũkamũthembea Yeova ĩkeethĩwa tũtena thanthatũ twa malondu tũte kĩema na ndũũme ĩte kĩema mũthenya wa savato; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
