              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ũũ nĩw’o Mwĩaĩi Yeova ũnũkwasya: Ethĩwa mũnene wĩ mbee ũsumbĩnĩ akanenga ũmwe o na wĩva wa ana make mũthĩnzĩo, nĩ ũtiĩwa wake, ũkeethĩwa wa ana make; nĩ ũtiĩwa woo wa kũtiĩwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ĩndĩ ethĩwa akanenga ũmwe wa athũkũmi make mũthĩnzĩo kuma ũtiĩwanĩ wake, ũkeethĩwa wake kũvika mwaka wa ũthasyo; nĩvo ĩndĩ ũkamũsyokea ũla mũnene; ĩndĩ ũvoo wa ũtiĩwa wake, naw’o ũkeethĩwa wa ana make. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.17"
            ]
          }
        },
